[{:adr/authoritative_for ["ai-gftd-yukkuri's clj port (PR #4) is intentionally plan-only (no external HTTP) per clj/README.md; upload_youtube/publish_youtube/update_youtube_metadata graphs and yukkuri.voicevox need a real-execution counterpart to become useful, which this ADR supplies as two new standalone libraries rather than embedding real IO back into yukkuri's runtime" "kotoba-lang/youtube-upload (Python, real, working) already exists and its own README recommends wrapping (RPC/subprocess bridge) rather than rewriting for Clojure consumers -- this ADR does the rewrite anyway by explicit owner request, re-deriving (not reinventing) the same request/response shapes from that proven client" "no VOICEVOX client existed anywhere in the tree prior to this ADR; jp-hiroshiba-voicevox's style_id/emotion catalog is ported verbatim from ai-gftd-yukkuri's yukkuri.voicevox (itself already correct, ported from lg_yukkuri/voicevox_client.py), not re-derived from scratch" "naming: com-youtube follows the existing com-<vendor> reverse-domain convention (kotoba-lang/com-cloudflare precedent); jp-hiroshiba-voicevox introduces a new jp-<author>-<project> convention for individually authored (non-corporate) Japanese OSS, since VOICEVOX (by Hiroshiba Kazuyuki) has no company domain to reverse" "both repos follow kotoba-lang/com-cloudflare's exact template: pure .cljc request/response shaping + one injectable :http-fn ({:url :method :headers :body} -> {:status ...}) for the real java.net.http transport, tested only against a stub, never a live account/engine" "neither library is wired into ai-gftd-yukkuri yet -- that requires real credentials (YouTube OAuth client/refresh-token, operator-provided per docs/youtube-upload-setup.md) and a live, reachable VOICEVOX engine (none exists today; the 2026-05-31 k8s voicevox-engine Helm deploy is confirmed dead, ADR-2607031540), both out of scope for this ADR"], :adr/topic "kotoba-lang", :adr/related ["gftdcojp/ai-gftd-yukkuri PR #4 (py->cljc pipeline-graph migration this ADR follows up on)" "kotoba-lang/youtube-upload (Python client this rewrites, against its own README's advice)" "kotoba-lang/com-cloudflare (the injectable :http-fn template both new repos follow)" "ADR-2607031540 (yukkuri render path -> cloud-murakumo; confirms no live VOICEVOX/GPU backend exists)" "ADR-2606302300 (org taxonomy; kotoba-lang library-placement rule)"], :adr/status "accepted", :adr/id "adr-2607043000-com-youtube-jp-hiroshiba-voicevox-real-clients", :adr/doc_type "adr", :adr/last_verified "2026-07-04", :db/id -1, :adr/authoritative true, :adr/scope "{:new_repos [\"kotoba-lang/com-youtube\" \"kotoba-lang/jp-hiroshiba-voicevox\"], :com_youtube {:namespaces [\"youtube.client\" \"youtube.videos\" \"youtube.captions\" \"youtube.thumbnails\"], :tests 8, :assertions 35}, :jp_hiroshiba_voicevox {:namespaces [\"voicevox.client\" \"voicevox.speakers\" \"voicevox.synthesize\"], :tests 6, :assertions 28}, :wired_into_yukkuri false, :live_backend_confirmed false}", :adr/title "ADR-2607043000: kotoba-lang/com-youtube + kotoba-lang/jp-hiroshiba-voicevox -- real HTTP clients for yukkuri's plan-only ports"}]